+/* GIMP - The GNU Image Manipulation Program
+ * chopgimp-materialtools.c — ChopGimp 3.29.1: outil Transition and outil
+ * Filet (see chopgimp-materialtools.h)
+ *
+ * Transition (Illustrator W): a click on an object, a click on another
+ * one: a blend group of the two (Vecteur > Transition > Options for the
+ * spacing). Échap forgets the first click.
+ *
+ * Filet (Illustrator U), on the objects of the active vector layer:
+ *  - an object whose fill is a « filet de dégradé »: its nodes are shown;
+ *    drag a node to move it, Maj+clic on a node gives it the foreground
+ *    color, a click elsewhere inside the object adds a row and a column
+ *    there (with the foreground color);
+ *  - an object filled with a plain color or a gradient: a click turns its
+ *    fill into a 1 × 1 mesh and adds the row and column at the click;
+ *  - an object whose fill is a « dégradé libre »: its points are shown;
+ *    a click adds a point (foreground color), drag moves one, Maj+clic
+ *    colors it, Alt+clic removes it.
+ * One undo step per gesture.
